{'symbol': 'NXPI', 'date': '2022-06-06 17:00:00', 'title': "NXP SEMICONDUCTORS SHAREHOLDERS ELECT ALL NOMINATED DIRECTORS; CHUNYUAN GU JOINS THE COMPANY'S BOARD OF DIRECTORS", 'text': "EINDHOVEN, THE NETHERLANDS, JUNE 06, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- NXP SEMICONDUCTORS N.V. (NASDAQ: NXPI) REPORTS THAT AT ITS ANNUAL GENERAL MEETING (“AGM”), SHAREHOLDERS OVERWHELMINGLY ELECTED ALL NOMINATED DIRECTORS, INCLUDING THE ADDITION OF CHUNYUAN GU TO THE COMPANY'S BOARD OF DIRECTORS AS NON-EXECUTIVE DIRECTOR."}